Cell["\<\
So, we found 3 isomorphisms. The last one correspond to the constructed \
tensorProductBasis. Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s check, for example the first \
possibility\
\>", "Text",
 Editable->True,
 TaggingRules->{},
