Cell["\<\
Test if main operations yields the same answers in both bases. In general we \
hope that only the geometric product will satisfy isomorphism. Other product \
is presented only for curiosity\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8965d358-296d-4c23-b3a9-46614a44f24d"],

