Cell["\<\
This section is unfinished, since \
gaDefineOrthonormalBasis[gaTensorProduct[Cl[2, 0], Cl[0, 2]]] yields \
different signs (due to improper  ordering of vector basis, we hope. It \
requires modification of gaDefineOrthonormalBasis[], we correct it in new \
release)\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"caa247a0-5169-4a77-b57e-406a926366d0"],

