Cell["\<\
How inner product should act in the tensor product basis.  From example \
below, it is clear that emulation of inner product might be possible, though \
not trivial.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0aa71dc0-4821-40b2-9d9f-6053fa535d9d"],

