Cell["\<\
With OuterProduct and Inner products we should have problems, since \
outer/inner product for field elements were not defined. We have to define \
them if we want a match\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"447adcee-1da5-40a7-819c-42ca838e2ba2"],

